      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'll definitely look into testing the pH, but \"unseen biological roadblocks\" is what's really sticking in my mind. It's just so eerie. It's like there's this whole hidden world down there, just out of sight, that's making these decisions. Do you think there actually *are* things living in the dirt—tiny, little things—that could be causing this kind of interference? Not just regular bacteria, but something more... troublesome?",
